          "FRAGE und VERNEINUNG mit dem do-Motor",
          "(wie bei did) — used wird zu use:",
          "",
          "  Did you use to live here?          Drücke 3",
          "",
          "  I didn't use to like it.           Drücke 4"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "I used to work here.",
          "2": "She used to play every day.",
          "3": "Did you use to live here?",
          "4": "I didn't use to like it."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Zwei ähnliche Formen NICHT verwechseln:",
          "",
          "  used to + Verb = eine frühere",
          "  Gewohnheit (jetzt vorbei):",
          "     I used to have long hair.       Drücke 1",
          "     (nicht mehr)",
          "",
          "  be used to + Sache = daran gewöhnt sein:",
