          "Es ist dieselbe -ing-Form wie für 'jetzt',",
          "aber mit der Vergangenheit von be:",
          "",
          "  I / he / she / it  was",
          "  you / we / they     were"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "She was sleeping.",
          "2": "We were carrying the boxes."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Zwei Zeiten erzählen zusammen:",
          "",
          "  die lange Szene = was/were + -ing",
          "  das kurze Ereignis = past simple",
          "",
          "  I was carrying the box when I fell.",
          "  Szene: was carrying / Ereignis: fell",
          "",
          "Deutsch hat KEINE Verlaufsform. Beides",
